+| Boolean          | `bool`  <br> [参考](doc/type-conversion.md#boolean)                                     |
+| Number           | `uint8_t`, `int8_t`, `uint16_t`, `int16_t`, `short`, `int32`, `uint32`, `int64`, `float`, `double`, `enum` <br> [参考](doc/type-conversion.md#number) |
+| String           | `const char*`, `std::string` <br> [参考](doc/type-conversion.md#string)                |
+| Array            | `std::vector<T>`, `std::array<T, N>` <br> [参考](doc/type-conversion.md#array)            |
+| Function         | `std::function<R (P...)>` <br> `aki::Callback<R (P...)>` <br> `aki::SafetyCallback<R (P...)>` <br> [参考](doc/type-conversion.md#function) |
+| Class Object      | `class`                                     |
+| JsonObject       | `std::map<std::string,T>` <br> [参考](doc/type-conversion.md#jsonobject)                                  |
